 entries.push(['自动关联尝试需要阶段时间上限','Automatic association requires a stage time limit.'],['结果读取已取消','Result reading cancelled.'],['正在取消结果读取…','Cancelling result reading…'],['结果读取超时，请重试或在完整命令中使用 --show','Result reading timed out. Retry or use --show in Command editor.'],['配置保存线程已停止','The settings writer has stopped.'],['关联方式 9：主字典留空时从哈希文件读取账户线索；提供字典时按行一一配对，需要相同的行数和每个哈希独立的盐。自动关联包含无固定终点的概率阶段，因此必须设置时间上限。','Association mode 9: leave the main wordlist empty to use account hints from the hash file. With a wordlist, lines are paired one to one and counts must match. Each hash needs a distinct salt. Automatic association includes an unbounded probability phase and requires a time limit.']);
