 entries.push(['请使用 HashHelm 桌面程序打开工作台','Open the workspace in the HashHelm desktop application'],['复制终端命令','Copy terminal command'],['查看可复制的终端命令','View a copyable terminal command'],['Windows 使用 WebView2，macOS 使用系统 WebKit，Linux 使用 WebKitGTK 4.1。macOS 和 Linux 默认保存到用户数据目录；Linux 可用 portable.flag 启用便携工作区。任务、候选、结果与日志可能包含明文密码，均在本机处理。','Windows uses WebView2; macOS uses system WebKit; Linux uses WebKitGTK 4.1. macOS and Linux save in the user data directory by default. On Linux, portable.flag enables a portable workspace. Tasks, candidates, results and logs can contain plaintext passwords and stay on this computer.'],['示例仅适用于 MD5。界面将 JSON 中的每一项作为独立参数传给程序，不经过命令行解释器。复制命令会按当前系统处理引号，含空格的路径也可以使用。','This example is for MD5 only. Each JSON item is a literal process argument, without a shell. Copied commands quote arguments for the current platform, including paths with spaces.']);
 entries.push(["填写 JSON 字符串数组，不含引擎可执行文件。路径可使用 /，反斜杠需写成 \\\\。执行不经过命令行解释器。","Enter a JSON string array without the engine executable. Use / in paths, or escape backslashes as \\\\. No shell is used."]);
 entries.push(['关于','About'],['关于 HashHelm','About HashHelm'],['基于 Rust 的轻量 Hashcat 图形工作台。','A lightweight Hashcat workbench built with Rust.'],['原作者','Original author'],['官方网站','Official website'],['原始项目','Original project'],['许可证','License'],['阅读完整许可证','Read the full license'],['允许免费使用、商用、修改及闭源衍生；分发时须保留原作者署名与许可声明。','Free use, commercial use, modifications and closed-source derivatives are permitted. Redistribution must retain the original attribution and license notices.'],['Hashcat、第三方库、字典和规则继续遵循各自的许可证。详见随附的 THIRD_PARTY.md 和组件许可文件。','Hashcat, third-party libraries, dictionaries and rules retain their respective licenses. See the included THIRD_PARTY.md and component notices.']);
