 entries.push(...[["读取卷头", "Read header"], ["容器参数已更改，请重新读取卷头。", "Container settings changed. Read the header again."], ["文件类型已更改，请重新分析。", "File type changed. Analyze the file again."], ["正在校验卷头…", "Verifying volume header…"], ["在 VeraCrypt 中打开", "Open in VeraCrypt"], ["算法组合后超过 100 个阶段，请减少掩码或缩小算法范围", "More than 100 stages after expanding algorithms. Reduce masks or select fewer algorithms."], ["VeraCrypt 容器", "VeraCrypt containers"], ["拖入 .hc / .vc 文件，或将文件类型改为 VeraCrypt。根据创建时的设置选择 PRF、XTS 密钥长度和卷头位置；常见组合是 SHA-512、512 bit、普通卷。参数不确定时可选择两种常见 PRF 或全部密钥长度，计划会分开显示每一种尝试。", "Drop a .hc / .vc file, or select VeraCrypt as the file type. Choose the original PRF, XTS key length and header location. SHA-512, 512 bit and normal header is a common combination. When unknown, select both common PRFs or all key lengths; each appears as a separate stage."], ["PIM 留空使用默认值；已知 PIM 时起止填写相同值，未知时可指定范围。使用了密钥文件的容器必须提供原密钥文件。读取卷头不会挂载容器，也不会扫描整个数据区。", "Leave PIM blank for the default, use the same start/end for a known PIM, or select a range. Volumes using keyfiles require the original files. Reading a header does not mount the volume or scan its data area."], ["恢复后会独立校验卷头的 VERA 标记和两处 CRC32。验证通过只说明密码和卷头匹配，不能证明全部数据完好。打开 VeraCrypt，选择原容器，输入恢复的密码、PIM 和密钥文件后打开。HashHelm 不自动挂载，也不把卷头当成已解密的文件导出。", "Recovered passwords are independently checked against the VERA marker and both header CRC32 values. This confirms the header password, not the integrity of all volume data. Select the original file in VeraCrypt and use the recovered password, PIM and original keyfiles. HashHelm does not mount volumes or export a header as decrypted content."]]);
